{"ts": 0.029797, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 3 · Files and operations\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 257}
{"ts": 0.031614, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 3 — Files and operations\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThree lessons, then a gate. You'll create, read, copy, move, and remove\r\nfiles. \u001b[91mrm is immediate.\u001b[0m It does not move things to a trash.\r\nWe'll do everything inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-uro7yb6a/stage3\u001b[0m so practice is\r\ncontained.\r\n\r\nCommands this stage:\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch\u001b[0m   create an empty file (or update its timestamp)\r\n  \u001b[92mmkdir\u001b[0m   create a folder\r\n  \u001b[92mrmdir\u001b[0m   remove an EMPTY folder\r\n  \u001b[92mcat\u001b[0m     print a text file\r\n  \u001b[92mless\u001b[0m    page through a long file (exit with \u001b[95mq\u001b[0m)\r\n  \u001b[92mcp\u001b[0m      copy\r\n  \u001b[92mmv\u001b[0m      move (or rename — same command)\r\n  \u001b[92mrm\u001b[0m      remove a file (\u001b[91mimmediate\u001b[0m)\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to begin lesson 3.1.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 806}
{"ts": 0.032063, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
