{"ts": 0.109014, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "The terminal is a quiet room.\r\nYou speak to it, it answers back.\r\nWords have shapes here, and shapes have weight.\r\nA pipe is a doorway between rooms.\r\n", "len": 151}
