{"ts": 0.153988, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 3 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.154394, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.154436, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ1: Which command creates an empty file?  (touch, mkdir, new, cat)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 77}
