{"ts": 0.161605, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ2: After \u001b[92mrm important.txt\u001b[0m, where is the file?  (~/.Trash, on disk, gone, depends)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 126}
