{"ts": 0.182403, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 3 · Files and operations\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93mtask\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 249}
{"ts": 0.184049, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 3 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nYou will work inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-uro7yb6a/stage3\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\nDo these, in order:\r\n\r\n  1. create a file \u001b[94mnotes.txt\u001b[0m containing the word \u001b[36mhello\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[90m(hint: \u001b[92mecho hello > notes.txt\u001b[0m\u001b[90m)\u001b[0m\r\n  2. copy \u001b[94mnotes.txt\u001b[0m to \u001b[94mbackup.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  3. rename \u001b[94mnotes.txt\u001b[0m to \u001b[94mdone.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  4. remove \u001b[94mbackup.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m. The script will look at the folder.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: done.txt exists with 'hello' in it; notes.txt and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mbackup.txt are gone.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 671}
{"ts": 0.184465, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.200401, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[95mcheck\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ test your work\u001b[0m   \u001b[95mshow\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ the task again\u001b[0m   \u001b[95mquit\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ save and leave\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
