{"ts": 0.218448, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m✓ Stage 3 cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nYou can now:\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch         \u001b[0m \u001b[90mmake an empty file\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mmkdir         \u001b[0m \u001b[90mmake a folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mrmdir         \u001b[0m \u001b[90mremove an empty folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcat           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mprint a file\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mless          \u001b[0m \u001b[90mpage through a file (q leaves)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcp            \u001b[0m \u001b[90mcopy a file\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mmv            \u001b[0m \u001b[90mmove or rename a file\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mrm            \u001b[0m \u001b[90mdelete a file (no undo)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mNext: Stage 4 · Commands, streams, composition\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for Stage 4, or \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to stop here. Your place is saved.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 657}
